<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Rss on 0x32++</title><link>https://blog.0x32.co.uk/tags/rss/</link><description>Recent content in Rss on 0x32++</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-us</language><lastBuildDate>Wed, 10 Jul 2013 09:51:00 +0100</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://blog.0x32.co.uk/tags/rss/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Tiny Tiny RSS Part 2</title><link>https://blog.0x32.co.uk/posts/tiny-tiny-rss-part-2/</link><pubDate>Wed, 10 Jul 2013 09:51:00 +0100</pubDate><guid>https://blog.0x32.co.uk/posts/tiny-tiny-rss-part-2/</guid><description>&lt;blockquote&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Note:&lt;/strong&gt; 1 of this post&amp;rsquo;s 7 links are now broken — mostly dead 2008–2013 feed-syndication infrastructure (FeedBurner, Gawker, AOL&amp;rsquo;s old blog network, Pheedo, Yahoo Pipes). Left as originally published.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&#10;&lt;div dir="ltr" style="text-align: left;" trbidi="on"&gt;&#10;Installed the clean looking &lt;a href="https://github.com/asyncopation/ttrss-theme-chalk" target="_blank"&gt;Chalk Theme&lt;/a&gt; on my &lt;a href="http://tt-rss.org/redmine/projects/tt-rss/wiki" target="_blank"&gt;Tiny Tiny RSS server&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;running on my &lt;a href="http://www.raspberrypi.org/" target="_blank"&gt;Raspberry Pi&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br /&gt;&#10;&lt;br /&gt;&#10;&lt;div class="separator" style="clear: both; text-align: center;"&gt;&#10;&lt;a href="https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEg-wK_4lm384Y8S0euxwmtbjZnptwSGOOeK-y2htkvfTrWRP0jE1dRPYvoxacmqi4KKhYw-UHfCQ8Nqi66CDblrjAr2fTceAQydxxtxC3eAR9rWAy3k7oII-t-Yt92alzoZSmKgaiPyBHw/s1600/Clipboard-1.png" imageanchor="1" style="margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;"&gt;&lt;img border="0" height="260" src="https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEg-wK_4lm384Y8S0euxwmtbjZnptwSGOOeK-y2htkvfTrWRP0jE1dRPYvoxacmqi4KKhYw-UHfCQ8Nqi66CDblrjAr2fTceAQydxxtxC3eAR9rWAy3k7oII-t-Yt92alzoZSmKgaiPyBHw/s320/Clipboard-1.png" width="320" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;br /&gt;&#10;&lt;br /&gt;&#10;&lt;br /&gt;&#10;&lt;a href="http://meekgonkey.blogspot.com/"&gt;Doodle's Geek Monkey&lt;/a&gt; by &lt;a href="http://twitter.com/alastair_hm"&gt;Alastair Montgomery&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description></item><item><title>Tiny Tiny RSS</title><link>https://blog.0x32.co.uk/posts/tiny-tiny-rss/</link><pubDate>Fri, 28 Jun 2013 11:49:00 +0100</pubDate><guid>https://blog.0x32.co.uk/posts/tiny-tiny-rss/</guid><description>&lt;blockquote&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Note:&lt;/strong&gt; 1 of this post&amp;rsquo;s 4 links are now broken — mostly dead 2008–2013 feed-syndication infrastructure (FeedBurner, Gawker, AOL&amp;rsquo;s old blog network, Pheedo, Yahoo Pipes). Left as originally published.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&#10;&lt;div dir="ltr" style="text-align: left;" trbidi="on"&gt;&#10;&lt;div style="font-size: 0.8em; line-height: 1.6em; margin: 0 0 10px 0; padding: 0;"&gt;&#10;&lt;a href="http://www.flickr.com/photos/doodle_m/9158795086/" title="Tiny Tiny RSS"&gt;&lt;img alt="Tiny Tiny RSS by Alastair Montgomery" src="http://farm4.staticflickr.com/3784/9158795086_28c0c7db2e.jpg" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&#10;&lt;span style="margin: 0;"&gt;&lt;a href="http://www.flickr.com/photos/doodle_m/9158795086/"&gt;Tiny Tiny RSS&lt;/a&gt;, a photo by &lt;a href="http://www.flickr.com/photos/doodle_m/"&gt;Alastair Montgomery&lt;/a&gt; on Flickr.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;Running Tiny Tiny RSS News Feed reader on my Raspberry Pi.&lt;br /&gt;&#10;&lt;br /&gt;&#10;Setup on Lighttpd and MySQL using the instructions on &lt;a href="http://tt-rss.org/redmine/projects/tt-rss/wiki"&gt;http://tt-rss.org/redmine/projects/tt-rss/wiki&lt;/a&gt; as a replacement to Google Reader.&lt;br /&gt;&#10;&lt;br /&gt;&#10;Working well so far.&lt;/div&gt;</description></item><item><title>Ruby and RSS</title><link>https://blog.0x32.co.uk/posts/ruby-and-rss/</link><pubDate>Thu, 21 Jul 2011 16:00:00 +0100</pubDate><guid>https://blog.0x32.co.uk/posts/ruby-and-rss/</guid><description>&lt;blockquote&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Note:&lt;/strong&gt; 1 of this post&amp;rsquo;s 4 links are now broken — mostly dead 2008–2013 feed-syndication infrastructure (FeedBurner, Gawker, AOL&amp;rsquo;s old blog network, Pheedo, Yahoo Pipes). Left as originally published.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&#10;&lt;div dir="ltr" style="text-align: left;" trbidi="on"&gt;Started looking into access RSS from Ruby discovered it pretty much already built in as described in this article &lt;a href="http://www.developer.com/services/article.php/3733171/Consuming-RSS-Feeds-with-Ruby.htm"&gt;Consuming RSS Feeds with Ruby&lt;/a&gt;, full docs are available in the &lt;a href="http://www.ruby-doc.org/stdlib/libdoc/rss/rdoc/index.html"&gt;Ruby Standard Library&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br /&gt;&#10;&lt;br /&gt;&#10;Accessing an RSS Feed is as simple as the following code snippet.&lt;br /&gt;&#10;&lt;br /&gt;&#10;&lt;span style="font-family: &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Courier&amp;quot;, monospace;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: small;"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color: #cccccc;"&gt;require "rss"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&#10;&lt;span style="font-family: &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Courier&amp;quot;, monospace;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: small;"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color: #cccccc;"&gt;rss_feed = "http://meekgonkey.blogspot.com/feeds/posts/default?alt=rss"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&#10;&lt;span style="font-family: &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Courier&amp;quot;, monospace;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: small;"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color: #cccccc;"&gt;rss_content = ""&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&#10;&lt;span style="font-family: &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Courier&amp;quot;, monospace;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: small;"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color: #cccccc;"&gt;open(rss_feed) { |f|&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&#10;&lt;span style="font-family: &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Courier&amp;quot;, monospace;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: small;"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color: #cccccc;"&gt;rss_content = f.read&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&#10;&lt;span style="font-family: &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Courier&amp;quot;, monospace;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: small;"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color: #cccccc;"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&#10;&lt;span style="font-family: &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Courier&amp;quot;, monospace;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: small;"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color: #cccccc;"&gt;puts "Bytes read #{rss_content.length} from feed"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&#10;&lt;span style="font-family: &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Courier&amp;quot;, monospace;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: small;"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color: #cccccc;"&gt;rss = RSS::Parser.parse(rss_content,false)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&#10;&lt;span style="font-family: &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Courier&amp;quot;, monospace;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: small;"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color: #cccccc;"&gt;puts "Title: #{rss.channel.title}"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&#10;&lt;span style="font-family: &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Courier&amp;quot;, monospace;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: small;"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color: #cccccc;"&gt;puts "RSS URL: #{rss.channel.link}"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&#10;&lt;span style="font-family: &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Courier&amp;quot;, monospace;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: small;"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color: #cccccc;"&gt;puts "Total entries: #{rss.items.size}"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&#10;&lt;span style="font-family: &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Courier&amp;quot;, monospace;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: small;"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color: #cccccc;"&gt;rss.items.each { |item|&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&#10;&lt;span style="font-family: &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Courier&amp;quot;, monospace;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: small;"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color: #cccccc;"&gt;puts item.title&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&#10;&lt;span style="font-family: &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Courier&amp;quot;, monospace;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: small;"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color: #cccccc;"&gt;puts item.link&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&#10;&lt;span style="font-family: &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Courier&amp;quot;, monospace;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: small;"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color: #cccccc;"&gt;puts item.date&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&#10;&lt;span style="font-family: &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Courier&amp;quot;, monospace;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: small;"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color: #cccccc;"&gt;puts "---"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&#10;&lt;span style="font-family: &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Courier&amp;quot;, monospace;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: small;"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color: #cccccc;"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&#10;&lt;br /&gt;&#10;Which when run produces something along the lines of;&lt;br /&gt;&#10;&lt;span style="font-size: x-small;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Courier&amp;quot;, monospace;"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color: #cccccc;"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color: white;"&gt;Bytes read 115009 from feed&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&#10;&lt;span style="font-size: x-small;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Courier&amp;quot;, monospace;"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color: #cccccc;"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color: white;"&gt;Title: Geek Monkey&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&#10;&lt;span style="font-size: x-small;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Courier&amp;quot;, monospace;"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color: #cccccc;"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color: white;"&gt;RSS URL: http://meekgonkey.blogspot.com/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&#10;&lt;span style="font-size: x-small;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Courier&amp;quot;, monospace;"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color: #cccccc;"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color: white;"&gt;Total entries: 25&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&#10;&lt;span style="font-size: x-small;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Courier&amp;quot;, monospace;"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color: #cccccc;"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color: white;"&gt;Twitter from Ruby&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&#10;&lt;span style="font-size: x-small;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Courier&amp;quot;, monospace;"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color: #cccccc;"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color: white;"&gt;http://meekgonkey.blogspot.com/2011/07/twitter-from-ruby.html&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&#10;&lt;span style="font-size: x-small;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Courier&amp;quot;, monospace;"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color: #cccccc;"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color: white;"&gt;Thu, 21 Jul 2011 13:20:00 +0100&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&#10;&lt;span style="font-size: x-small;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Courier&amp;quot;, monospace;"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color: #cccccc;"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color: white;"&gt;---&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&#10;&lt;span style="font-size: x-small;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Courier&amp;quot;, monospace;"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color: #cccccc;"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color: white;"&gt;Github&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&#10;&lt;span style="font-size: x-small;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Courier&amp;quot;, monospace;"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color: #cccccc;"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color: white;"&gt;http://meekgonkey.blogspot.com/2011/07/github.html&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&#10;&lt;span style="font-size: x-small;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Courier&amp;quot;, monospace;"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color: #cccccc;"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color: white;"&gt;Mon, 18 Jul 2011 13:59:00 +0100&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&#10;&lt;span style="font-size: x-small;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Courier&amp;quot;, monospace;"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color: #cccccc;"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color: white;"&gt;---&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&#10;&lt;span style="font-size: x-small;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Courier&amp;quot;, monospace;"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color: #cccccc;"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color: white;"&gt;Google Plus&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&#10;&lt;span style="font-size: x-small;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Courier&amp;quot;, monospace;"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color: #cccccc;"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color: white;"&gt;http://meekgonkey.blogspot.com/2011/07/google-plus.html&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&#10;&lt;span style="font-size: x-small;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Courier&amp;quot;, monospace;"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color: #cccccc;"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color: white;"&gt;Fri, 01 Jul 2011 10:50:00 +0100&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&#10;&lt;span style="font-size: x-small;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Courier&amp;quot;, monospace;"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color: #cccccc;"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color: white;"&gt;---&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&#10;&lt;span style="font-size: x-small;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Courier&amp;quot;, monospace;"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color: #cccccc;"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color: white;"&gt;WATIR makes a tester's life easier.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&#10;&lt;span style="font-size: x-small;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Courier&amp;quot;, monospace;"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color: #cccccc;"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color: white;"&gt;http://meekgonkey.blogspot.com/2011/06/watir-makes-testers-life-easier.html&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&#10;&lt;span style="font-size: x-small;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Courier&amp;quot;, monospace;"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color: #cccccc;"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color: white;"&gt;Wed, 29 Jun 2011 14:36:00 +0100&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&#10;&lt;span style="font-size: x-small;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Courier&amp;quot;, monospace;"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color: #cccccc;"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color: white;"&gt;---&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&#10;&lt;span style="font-size: x-small;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Courier&amp;quot;, monospace;"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color: #cccccc;"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color: white;"&gt;Setting browser size and position with watir-webdriver&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&#10;&lt;span style="font-size: x-small;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Courier&amp;quot;, monospace;"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color: #cccccc;"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color: white;"&gt;http://meekgonkey.blogspot.com/2011/06/setting-browser-size-and-position-with.html&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&#10;&lt;span style="font-size: x-small;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Courier&amp;quot;, monospace;"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color: #cccccc;"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color: white;"&gt;Thu, 23 Jun 2011 09:22:00 +0100&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&#10;&lt;span style="font-size: x-small;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Courier&amp;quot;, monospace;"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color: #cccccc;"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color: white;"&gt;---&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&#10;&lt;span style="font-size: x-small;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Courier&amp;quot;, monospace;"&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&#10;&lt;br /&gt;&#10;&lt;br /&gt;&#10;&lt;a href="http://meekgonkey.blogspot.com/"&gt;Doodle's Geek Monkey&lt;/a&gt; by &lt;a href="http://twitter.com/alastair_hm"&gt;Alastair Montgomery&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description></item><item><title>Monitor Folders By RSS</title><link>https://blog.0x32.co.uk/posts/monitor-folders-by-rss/</link><pubDate>Wed, 28 Jan 2009 09:36:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://blog.0x32.co.uk/posts/monitor-folders-by-rss/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;I&amp;rsquo;m sure I can think of a use for this &lt;em&gt;scratches head&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;div style="margin: 0px 2px; padding-top: 1px; background-color: #c3d9ff; font-size: 1px !important; line-height: 0px !important;"&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div style="margin: 0px 1px; padding-top: 1px; background-color: #c3d9ff; font-size: 1px !important; line-height: 0px !important;"&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div style="padding: 4px; background-color: #c3d9ff;"&gt;&lt;h3 style="margin:0px 3px;font-family:sans-serif"&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;/div&gt; &lt;div style="margin: 0px 1px; padding-top: 1px; background-color: #c3d9ff; font-size: 1px !important; line-height: 0px !important;"&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div style="margin: 0px 2px; padding-top: 1px; background-color: #c3d9ff; font-size: 1px !important; line-height: 0px !important;"&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div style="font-family:sans-serif;overflow:auto;width:100%;margin: 0px 10px"&gt;&lt;h2 style="margin: 0.25em 0 0 0"&gt;&lt;div class=""&gt;&lt;a href="http://www.ghacks.net/2009/01/28/monitor-folders-by-rss/"&gt;Monitor Folders By RSS&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/h2&gt; &lt;div style="margin-bottom: 0.5em"&gt;via &lt;a href="http://www.ghacks.net/" class="f"&gt;gHacks technology news&lt;/a&gt; by Martin on 28/01/09&lt;/div&gt; &lt;p&gt;If you are one of those Internet users living in their RSS feed reader you might like Folder RSS. Folder RSS is a folder monitor that creates a valid RSS feed that can be accessed using any RSS reader. The feed will contain the changes made to specified folders. The software program is fully portable and script driven meaning that it is necessary to write a short batch script or run the software from the command line to create the valid RSS feed. It should also be noted that the feed will be updated locally which is not a problem for desktop feed readers. The use of feed readers like Google Reader on the other hand would require to input the IP of the local computer along with the path to the feed making sure that the remote feed reader is allowed to access the file on the local computer. &lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>